   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "«por lo que» and «a los que»",
     "texto": [
      "**per cui** (for which), **grazie a cui** (thanks to which), **ai quali** (to whom), **dei quali** (of whom).",
      "Example: **Gli amici, ai quali ho scritto, arrivano domani** (the friends I wrote to are arriving tomorrow)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "During and as",
     "texto": [
      "**Durante il quale** (during which). **In quanto amici** means «as friends»; **in quanto era tardi** means «since it was late».",
      "The causal meaning of **in quanto** introduces a clause with a verb; before a noun it usually expresses role or capacity."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
